```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:
Mayor Marian Orr, and City Council
FROM:
Sara Vasquez, Purchasing Manager
DATE:
May 11, 2018
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-14-18for a contract between the City of Cheyenne,
Engineering Department, and Reiman Corp, Cheyenne, WY, for the Civic Center
Commons Park project.
Three (3) bids were received for this project. The bid tab is attached
There is a $350,000.00 miscellaneous force account on this project.
The bid was reviewed by Amy Allen and Mark Escobedo and their recommendation is to accept
the low bid for the base bid, plus Alternate A, plus Alternate C from Reiman Corp., Cheyenne,
WY in the amount of$6,833,524.21.
The project was estimated tocost$7,727,374.75
Funding Source:
FEMA
SRF Loan
City Funds
```

